sequenceDiagram
  title Happy path
  actor user as Shopper
  participant shop as Webshop
  participant api as Checkout API
  participant psp as Payment Provider
  participant events as order.events
  participant mailx as mailx
  Note over user,shop: Customer buys a cart
  user->>shop: adds to cart
  Note over api: Validates cart
  alt payment method — card
    api->>psp: charge
  else invoice
    Note over api,psp: invoicing not in this story
  end
  par fan-out
    api->>events: order created
  and lane 2
    Note over mailx: send receipt
  end
  Note over user,mailx: PCI scope ends at PSP
  Note over user,mailx: Order stored
